# prebuilt stage / scratch artifacts (never publish)
mxc-s*
mxc-stage4*
probe144/

# Go+BoringCrypto's prebuilt shared objects. `src/crypto/internal/boring/syso`
# declares `//:build boringcrypto` and says it "only exists with
# GOEXPERIMENT=boringcrypto", and this compiler lists that experiment among the
# ones it does not support - nothing links these, and `build-goboring.sh`
# regenerates them. 4.5MB of generated binary, so it is not versioned.
src/crypto/internal/boring/syso/*.syso
/mxc-*
